    "When off, the notch hides while the lid is closed." : {
      "comment" : "Subtitle under Show on external displays in Settings > General.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn aus, wird die Notch bei geschlossenem Deckel ausgeblendet."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si está desactivado, el notch se oculta con la tapa cerrada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Désactivé, l'encoche se masque quand l'écran est rabattu."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフのときは、蓋を閉じている間ノッチを隠します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "끄면 덮개를 닫았을 때 노치가 숨겨져요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Desativado, o notch some quando a tampa está fechada."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭时，合上屏幕后刘海会隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Claude Code as your AI, Ask AI and AI Usage run your own signed-in claude CLI; %@ never reads your credentials. Set this only if claude isn't found automatically." : {
      "comment" : "Settings > Connections footer under Claude location; %@ is the app name (Tabbi), claude stays lowercase.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit Claude Code als KI nutzen KI fragen und KI-Nutzung dein angemeldetes claude CLI; %@ liest nie deine Zugangsdaten. Stell das nur ein, wenn claude nicht automatisch gefunden wird."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con Claude Code como tu IA, Pregunta a la IA y Uso de IA usan tu propio CLI claude con sesión iniciada; %@ nunca lee tus credenciales. Configúralo solo si claude no se detecta automáticamente."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avec Claude Code comme IA, Demander à l'IA et Usage IA utilisent ton CLI claude connecté ; %@ ne lit jamais tes identifiants. Ne règle ceci que si claude n'est pas trouvé automatiquement."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude CodeをAIにすると、「AIに質問」と「AI使用量」はサインイン済みのclaude CLIを使います。%@が認証情報を読むことはありません。claudeが自動で見つからない場合だけ設定してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude Code를 AI로 쓰면 AI에게 묻기와 AI 사용량이 로그인된 내 claude CLI를 실행해요. %@는 자격 증명을 절대 읽지 않아요. claude를 자동으로 찾지 못할 때만 설정하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Com o Claude Code como sua IA, Pergunte à IA e Uso de IA usam o seu próprio CLI claude conectado; o %@ nunca lê suas credenciais. Configure isto só se o claude não for encontrado automaticamente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将 Claude Code 设为 AI 时，“问 AI”和“AI 用量”会运行你已登录的 claude CLI；%@ 从不读取你的凭据。只有在无法自动找到 claude 时才需要设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works from any app. On Today, type right away to add a task." : {
      "comment" : "Settings > General subtitle under the shortcut; Today is the module name.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
